        <mxCell id="legend" value="A2A v1.0 alignment: task states submitted / working / input_required / auth_required / completed / failed / canceled / rejected&#10;are the SDK's own enum. tasks/cancel is protocol-level safe stop. Agent Card skills are how the planner discovers what stages exist." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F7FA;strokeColor=#CBD2D9;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontColor=#3E4C59;" vertex="1" parent="1">
